          "text": "Head and Shoulders shampoos typically range from about $5.94 for smaller bottles to around $20 for larger packs, such as twin packs. The prices can vary based on the specific product and retailer. For OUAI shampoos, you can expect to pay approximately $28 to $32 for their regular shampoos, as they are positioned as a premium brand. La Roche-Posay shampoos generally cost between $20 and $30, depending on the specific formulation and size. Always check for discounts or bundles, as these can significantly reduce the total cost.",
