          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 4,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That sounds promising, thanks! Are there any lightweight conditioners you\u2019d suggest that pair well with that for oily hair?",
          "user_rubrik": "What shampoos exist for an oily scalp and hair?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "For a lightweight conditioner that pairs well with the La Roche-Posay Kerium DS Anti-Dandruff Intensive Shampoo, I recommend the **La Roche-Posay Toleriane Conditioner**. It's designed for sensitive skin and provides hydration without weighing hair down, making it suitable for oily hair types. Additionally, you might consider the **K\u00e9rastase Specifique Cleansing Conditioner**, which is also lightweight and helps maintain scalp health while controlling oiliness. Both options will complement your shampoo and help keep your hair feeling fresh and light.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0023-63-08119:0": 0.40500855445861816,
            "clueweb22-en0019-00-09182:0": 0.29674333333969116,
