      {
        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s great, thanks! By the way, are there any special hair masks or treatments to help keep oily hair healthy?",
          "user_rubrik": "What shampoos exist for an oily scalp and hair?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "For oily hair, there are several effective hair masks and treatments that can help maintain a healthy scalp and hair. Here are a few recommendations:\n\n1. **L'Oreal Paris Elvive Extraordinary Clay Mask** - This mask is designed to purify the scalp and hydrate the lengths of your hair, making it great for oily roots and dry ends.\n\n2. **Briogeo Don\u2019t Despair, Repair! Deep Conditioning Mask** - While it's primarily for damaged hair, it also helps to balance moisture and can be beneficial if your hair is both oily and dry.\n\n3. **Moroccanoil Intense Hydrating Mask** - This mask hydrates and nourishes while being lightweight enough for oily hair types.\n\n4. **Maui Moisture Heal & Hydrate + Shea Butter Hair Mask** - This vegan formula deeply nourishes and helps repair split ends without weighing hair down.\n\n5. **Aloe Vera Gel Treatment** - You can also use pure aloe vera gel as a hair mask. It helps to balance oil production and soothe the scalp.\n\nUsing these treatments once a week can help keep your hair healthy while managing oiliness.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0005-16-05064:0": 0.09499434381723404
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 6,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thanks! I\u2019ve heard of OUAI and Head & Shoulders\u2014how do those brands compare for oily scalp and hair?",
          "user_rubrik": "Tell me more about OUAI and Head and Shoulders brands for shampoo for oily scalp and hair.\u00a0",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Both OUAI and Head & Shoulders offer products that cater to oily hair, but they have different focuses and formulations. \n\n**OUAI** is known for its high-quality, salon-inspired products that often include nourishing ingredients. Their shampoos, like the **OUAI Detox Shampoo**, are designed to remove buildup and excess oil while being gentle on the hair and scalp. OUAI products typically have a more luxurious feel and are focused on overall hair health.\n\n**Head & Shoulders**, on the other hand, specializes in anti-dandruff solutions. Their shampoos, such as the **Head & Shoulders Instant Oil Control Shampoo**, are specifically formulated to target dandruff and oily scalps. They contain active ingredients like pyrithione zinc, which helps to reduce flaking and control oiliness effectively.\n\nIf your primary concern is managing oiliness and dandruff, Head & Shoulders might be the better option. However, if you're looking for a more holistic approach to hair care with a focus on nourishment and styling, OUAI could be a great choice.",
