      {
        "turn": 4,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Great, thanks! Can you tell me a bit about OUAI and Head & Shoulders for oily scalp and hair? Are they good options?",
          "user_rubrik": "Tell me more about OUAI and Head and Shoulders brands for shampoo for oily scalp and hair.\u00a0",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "OUAI shampoos are known for their high-quality ingredients and luxurious feel. For oily scalps, their Detox Shampoo could be a good option as it helps remove buildup and excess oil without being overly harsh. However, since you\u2019re allergic to nuts, you should carefully check the ingredient list, as some OUAI products may contain nut-derived oils.\n\nHead & Shoulders, on the other hand, is a more affordable and widely available option. Their Instant Oil Control Shampoo is specifically designed for oily scalps and contains zinc pyrithione, which helps control oil and dandruff. It\u2019s a practical choice for managing excess oil while keeping your scalp healthy. Just ensure to avoid any variants with almond oil or other nut-derived ingredients to stay safe.",
          "citations": {
