    "responses": [
      {
        "turn": 1,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m looking for a good shampoo for oily hair. Any suggestions?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is a good shampoo for my hair?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For oily hair, you might want to consider a clarifying shampoo, which deeply cleanses the scalp and removes excess oil. Based on your frequent use of heat styling tools, a product like Paul Mitchell Tea Tree Special Shampoo could be a great option. It not only reduces grease but also has antimicrobial properties to maintain scalp health. Additionally, the invigorating tea tree and peppermint scent can leave your hair feeling refreshed. Pairing it with a lightweight conditioner can help maintain balance without adding extra weight to your hair.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0033-16-11758:4": 21.799100875854492,
            "clueweb22-en0033-16-11758:3": 20.884000778198242
