      {
        "turn": 2,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "What ingredients in the shampoo should I look out for?",
          "user_rubrik": "What ingredients in the shampoo i should look out for?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "When using Paul Mitchell Tea Tree Special Shampoo, you should look out for its key ingredients: tea tree oil, peppermint, and lavender. These natural components are known for their antimicrobial and soothing properties, which can help reduce oiliness and maintain scalp health. Additionally, the shampoo is paraben-free, vegan, and color-safe, making it a gentle option for regular use. Since you\u2019re allergic to nuts, it\u2019s good to know that this product does not list nut-based ingredients, but always double-check the label to ensure safety.",
