      {
        "turn": 3,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thanks! Are there any drugstore shampoos for oily scalp too?",
          "user_rubrik": "What shampoos exist for an oily scalp and hair?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For drugstore shampoos suitable for oily scalps, you might consider Head & Shoulders Classic Clean Anti-Dandruff Shampoo. It\u2019s dermatologist-recommended, removes excess oil, and has a refreshing lemon and peppermint scent. Another option is Biotique Green Apple Shampoo, which is organic, preservative-free, and ideal for daily use. Both are effective at controlling oil without harsh ingredients. Let me know if you\u2019d like more details!",
