          "text": "OUAI and Head & Shoulders both offer solutions for oily scalps, but they cater to different needs and preferences. \n\nOUAI products, such as their Scalp & Body Scrub, are known for their luxurious formulations and multi-purpose use. The scrub contains exfoliating ingredients that help remove buildup and excess oil from the scalp, making it a great option if you\u2019re looking for a premium product that also supports scalp health. This could be particularly beneficial for you since you use heat styling tools, as it helps maintain a clean and balanced scalp environment.\n\nHead & Shoulders, on the other hand, is a more budget-friendly option with a focus on dandruff control and oil management. Their Instant Oil Control Dandruff Shampoo is specifically designed for oily scalps, featuring zinc pyrithione to combat dandruff and mango and citrus essences for a fresh scent. It provides a deep clean while controlling oil and flakes, making it a practical choice for daily use. This shampoo is also pH-balanced, ensuring it\u2019s gentle on the scalp while effectively addressing oiliness.\n\nBoth options are effective, so your choice may depend on whether you prioritize luxury and multi-functionality (OUAI) or affordability and targeted dandruff control (Head & Shoulders).",
