          "text": "For hair that is frequently heat-styled and needs protection, consider shampoos like Thermafuse HeatSmart Serum Shampoo, TIGI Bed Head Styleshots Extreme Straight Shampoo, or L\u2019Or\u00e9al Paris Smooth Intense Ultimate Straight Shampoo. For nut allergies and sensitive skin, look for simple, fragrance-free formulations or shampoo bars from brands like Maple Hill Naturals or Living Naturally. Are you interested in fragrance-free or hypoallergenic hair products?",
