          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For oily scalps and nut allergies, Maple Holistics Degrease Shampoo is highly recommended as it is sulfate-free, balances sebum production, and does not contain nut oils [clueweb22-en0010-88-09918][clueweb22-en0016-47-18259]. Honeydew Lemon Sage Shampoo is another clarifying, sulfate-free option that uses lemon, sage, and tea tree oils for deep cleansing without nut-derived ingredients [clueweb22-en0001-78-15977]. PURA D\u2019OR Original Gold Label is a vegan, cruelty-free shampoo with a blend of biotin, nettle, pumpkin seed, and black cumin seed oils, and is formulated without common allergens or nut oils [clueweb22-en0016-47-18259]. Always double-check ingredient lists for any new product, as formulations can change. If you prefer a natural alternative, soap nut (reetha) is a traditional, nut-free cleanser for oily hair [clueweb22-en0035-76-19435].",
