          "text": "For oily hair that\u2019s heat-styled and nut-allergic, the best styling products are lightweight, oil-free, and avoid buildup or shine. Here\u2019s what works\u2014and why:\n\n**Top Product Types for Oily, Heat-Styled, Nut-Allergic Hair:**\n\n- **Dry Shampoo:** Instantly absorbs oil, adds texture, and extends time between washes. Look for powder or spray formulas free from nut oils and silicones (e.g., Beauty by Earth Organic Dry Shampoo, Living Proof Perfect Hair Day Dry Shampoo, No Nothing Very Sensitive Dry Shampoo).\n- **Matte Clays & Pomades:** Provide hold and volume without shine or greasiness. Choose water-based, nut oil-free options (e.g., Anchors Aweigh Courage Clay).\n- **Texturizing Sprays:** Add volume and grip without weighing hair down or adding oil (e.g., Not Your Mother\u2019s Double Take Dry Finish Texture Spray, Garnier Fructis Texture Tease).\n- **Lightweight Mousses:** Boost volume and control frizz without heaviness or oil (e.g., milk_shake",
