      {
        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thank you! I\u2019ll make sure to double-check the ingredients. \n\nCan you tell me more about the OUAI and Head & Shoulders brands for shampoo for oily scalp and hair?",
          "user_rubrik": "Tell me more about OUAI and Head and Shoulders brands for shampoo for oily scalp and hair.\u00a0",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For oily scalp and hair, OUAI offers a Super Dry Shampoo that absorbs oil and cuts through greasy strands using rice starch and volcanic minerals, providing volume (Passages 6, 17). Their Fine Hair Shampoo also aims for cleaner hair (Passage 18). OUAI generally formulates products free from parabens, sulfates, and phthalates (Passages 8, 12, 16). Note that the dry shampoo has a rose scent (Passage 6).\n\nHead & Shoulders is a leading anti-dandruff brand, with zinc pyrithione effectively treating oily scalp conditions (Passages 2, 19). Specific options for oily hair include \"Clinical Strength Advanced Oil Control\" (Passage 7), \"Instant Oil Control 2-in-1\" (Passage 15), and \"Classic Clean\" (Passage 19), which removes excess oil. The \"Instant Oil Control\" is not sulfate-free (Passage 15). Many H&S products have scents (e.g., lemon, peppermint, mango) (Passages 7, 10, 15, 19), and some may contain almond oil (Passages 7, 11). Always check product ingredients for nut-free and fragrance-free needs.",
