          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m looking for a good shampoo for my hair. Any suggestions?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is a good shampoo for my hair?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Given your frequent use of heat styling tools, consider shampoos designed to protect and repair. The TIGI Bed Head Styleshots Extreme Straight Shampoo and Tec Italy Metamorfosi Hair Straightening Shampoo are good options as they offer thermal protection. The Thermafuse HeatSmart Serum Shampoo helps repair damaged hair and is suitable for hair worn straight. K\u00e9rastase Sensidote Dermo-Calm Bain Riche is also recommended for hair exposed to heat daily. Look for ingredients like Cocamidopropyl to tame frizz and Dimethicone for heat styling protection.",
