      {
        "turn": 4,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s helpful, thanks! Are there any popular drugstore options for oily hair that are also gentle on the scalp?",
          "user_rubrik": "What shampoos exist for an oily scalp and hair?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For popular drugstore options that are gentle on an oily scalp, consider **OGX Clarifying Scalp with Tea Tree Oil** (Passages 1, 11) and **Nizoral Anti-Dandruff Shampoo** (Passage 13). OGX is reasonably priced, good for oily hair, and soothes irritated skin, though it has a minty scent. Nizoral is affordable and gentle for irritated scalps. **HealthKart Apple Cider Vinegar Shampoo** (Passage 3) is also very affordable and clarifies oily scalps.\n\nHowever, passages do not explicitly confirm if these are fragrance-free or nut-free. Given your nut allergy, it's crucial to always check the ingredient list directly on the product packaging.",
