        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That makes sense. I\u2019ll check Sephora and Amazon.  \n\nDo you know if La Roche-Posay actually makes shampoo for oily hair, or just skin care?",
          "user_rubrik": "What does Head and Shoulders, OUAI and La Roche-Posay shampoos cost?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "Yes, La Roche-Posay does produce hair care products, including shampoos. Based on dermatological research, their hair care line targets key issues affecting the hair and scalp, such as dandruff, hair loss, and hypersensitivity. While the passages don't explicitly mention \"oily hair\" shampoo, an oily scalp can fall under \"key issues affecting the scalp.\"",
