      {
        "turn": 2,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thanks, that\u2019s helpful! What ingredients in the shampoo should I look out for? I mean, both good and bad.",
          "user_rubrik": "What ingredients in the shampoo i should look out for?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For your oily scalp, look for shampoos with beneficial ingredients like salicylic acid, tea tree oil, apple cider vinegar, ginseng, chamomile, green tea, peppermint, or rosemary. These can help manage oil and maintain scalp health.\n\nConversely, try to avoid harmful ingredients such as parabens, sulfates, silicones, artificial colors, synthetic fragrances, phthalates, and mineral oil, as they can be harsh or lead to buildup.",
