        "turn": 4,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thank you for pointing that out! Do you know any shampoos specifically for oily scalp without nut oils?",
          "user_rubrik": "What shampoos exist for an oily scalp and hair?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "For an oily scalp without nut oils, consider Natralia Eczema & Psoriasis Wash & Shampoo, which is explicitly nut-oil free. You could also explore shampoo bars like Maple Hill Naturals (made with coconut, castor, shea, hemp seed oils) or Sappo Hill (avocado, palm, coconut, castor oils), as their ingredients typically avoid common nut oils. Free & Clear Shampoo is another option often recommended for sensitive users. Always double-check ingredient lists to ensure safety.",
