        "turn": 1,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Hi! I\u2019m looking for a good shampoo for my hair. Any suggestions? I have an oily scalp, if that helps.",
          "user_rubrik": "What is a good shampoo for my hair?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For your oily scalp, consider shampoos designed to clarify and reduce oil. Some popular options include:\n\n*   **Luseta Apple Cider Vinegar Shampoo:** Known for clearing impurities and soothing the scalp.\n*   **Neutrogena T/Sal Therapeutic Shampoo:** Contains salicylic acid to effectively break down scalp oil.\n*   **Paul Mitchell Shampoo Two:** Formulated to cleanse the scalp and reduce oil production.\n*   **Dr Groot Anti Hair Loss Shampoo for Oily Scalp:** Gently eliminates excess sebum and is suitable for daily use.\n\nUsing a clear shampoo and massaging it well into your scalp can also help manage oil.",
