        "turn": 6,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I like changing up my routines, including shampoo, every few months. I feel like it helps but maybe it\u2019s just in my head? Also, do you know much about the OUAI or Head & Shoulders brands for oily hair?",
          "user_rubrik": "Tell me more about OUAI and Head and Shoulders brands for shampoo for oily scalp and hair.\u00a0",
          "user_rubrik_score": 4,
          "text": "Regarding switching shampoos, while there's no direct information that changing shampoos every few months specifically helps manage an oily scalp, some dermatologists suggest rotating anti-dandruff shampoos if one seems to lose effectiveness over time.\n\nFor OUAI, the available information mentions a hair supplement, but not a specific shampoo for oily hair.\n\nHead & Shoulders, however, offers products like their 'Instant Oil Control Shampoo,' specifically formulated to tackle excess oils for a deep clean. It helps purify scalp pores, remove excess oil, and control oiliness, often containing ingredients like pyrithione zinc beneficial for oily scalps.",
