        "turn": 9,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Great, that\u2019s what I needed! Does the higher price of OUAI actually mean it\u2019s better than Head & Shoulders for oily hair?",
          "user_rubrik": "What does Head and Shoulders, OUAI and La Roche-Posay shampoos cost?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "A higher price doesn't automatically mean a shampoo is better or more effective for your specific needs. While OUAI offers luxury products, their effectiveness for oily hair compared to Head & Shoulders depends on individual results. OUAI has products like Detox Shampoo, designed to clarify and remove oil, and Super Dry Shampoo for oily hair. Head & Shoulders also offers specific formulations like their 'Instant Oil Control Shampoo' to manage excess oil.",
