          "text": "For oily scalps and heat-styled hair:\n\n**Head & Shoulders** offers several options like **Classic Clean** (controls oil, pH balanced) and **Instant Oil Control** or **Deep Cleanse Oil Control** shampoos, which specifically target excess oil and deep clean the scalp. Some **Head & Shoulders Supreme** lines include argan oil, beneficial for heat-styled hair, while managing scalp health.\n\n**OUAI** has the **Super Dry Shampoo** to absorb oil and add volume to oily hair. Their **Detox Shampoo** can also help with product build-up on the scalp, which can contribute to oiliness.",
