          "text": "Given that you frequently use heat styling tools, consider shampoos designed to protect against or repair heat damage.\n\nHere are some options:\n*   **Thermafuse HeatSmart Serum Shampoo** is formulated for heat-styled, damaged, or over-processed hair, offering protection and frizz control.\n*   **Garnier Fructis Damage Eraser Shampoo** helps repair severely damaged hair and prevents breakage from heat styling.\n*   **OGX Renewing + Argan Oil Of Morocco Shampoo** strengthens hair and protects against heat damage.\n*   **Design Essentials Agave & Lavender Moisturizing Hair Bath** protects hair from heat tools and can cut drying time.",
