      {
        "turn": 4,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Got it. Are there any tips for managing oily hair between washes?",
          "user_rubrik": "What shampoos exist for an oily scalp and hair?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "To manage oily hair between washes, dry shampoo is highly effective as it absorbs excess oil from the roots. Cornstarch or baby powder can also be used as alternatives. Additionally, consider applying a few drops of tea tree oil or peppermint oil through your hair, or using aloe vera gel on your scalp and hair tips to help control oil production.",
