        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Great, thank you! Are there any drugstore shampoos for oily hair that are safe for sensitive skin? I have to be careful with irritants.",
          "user_rubrik": "What shampoos exist for an oily scalp and hair?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For oily hair and sensitive skin, consider Free & Clear Shampoo. It's specifically formulated to avoid chemical irritants, being free of sulfates, fragrances, dyes, and parabens, and effectively controls oily scalp. Another good drugstore option is OGX Clarifying Scalp with Tea Tree Oil. It's safe for sensitive skin, targets oily hair, and contains soothing ingredients like tea tree oil and peppermint extract, while also being paraben-free and reasonably priced.",
