          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Hi! I\u2019m trying to figure out what a good shampoo would be for my oily scalp and hair. Any suggestions?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is a good shampoo for my hair?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For oily scalp and hair, consider shampoos with ingredients like salicylic acid, tea tree oil, or apple cider vinegar. Some expert-recommended options include Neutrogena T/Sal Therapeutic Shampoo (with salicylic acid), Chi Tea Tree Oil Shampoo, Paul Mitchell Tea Tree Special Shampoo, and HealthKart or WOW Apple Cider Vinegar Shampoos. Activated charcoal shampoos like Drybar On The Rocks Clarifying Charcoal Shampoo are also effective for deep cleansing and removing buildup.",
