          "text": "great \u2014 few solid, widely available options for oily scalps ( and why ) : - maple holistics tea tree shampoo \u2014 clarifying, tea \u2011 tree formula that helps control oil and scalp buildup. - neutrogena t / sal therapeutic shampoo \u2014 contains salicylic acid to exfoliate scalp buildup and reduce oiliness / flaking. - aromatica tea tree purifying shampoo \u2014 sulfate \u2011 free, tea tree + salicylic \u2011 style action for oily / itchy scalps. - nizoral anti \u2011 dandruff shampoo \u2014 ketoconazole antifungal helps if oiliness comes with dandruff / seborrheic dermatitis. - ogx extra strength refreshing + tea tree mint \u2014 budget option that removes residue and leaves a fresh, non \u2011 heavy feel. quick tips : avoid argan, macadamia, shea, and other nut \u2011 derived oils ( many \u201c argan \u201d / \u201c nut \u201d lines ) because they \u2019 re heavy and you \u2019 re nut \u2011 allergic. also skip sls and non \u2011 water \u2011 soluble silicones if you get buildup. rotate a clarifying scalp shampoo weekly with",
